                <h1>
  Apply to Bachelor&#039;s programmes in English</h1>
                                          <div class="aalto-article__ingress">
            
                    At Aalto University, you can study in bachelor’s programmes in English in the fields of business and economics, science and technology as well as art and design. The next application period for programmes taught in English is 7–22 January 2027. On this website, you&#039;ll find the descriptions and application guidelines for all Aalto&#039;s bachelor&#039;s programmes in English. You will also find information on student admissions and experiences of studying at Aalto!
            
          </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>

          <div class="aalto-article__hero-wrap full-bleed-container full-bleed-container--hero">
        <div class="aalto-article__hero-container aalto-article__hero-container--default">
                    


<figure>
  <div class="">
    <div class="media-with-caption__container">
      
                    


  
      
                        <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/2_3_1040w_452h_n/public/2024-10/1588568.jpg?h=be7d0682&amp;itok=yN9mSoSV 1040w, /sites/default/files/styles/2_3_1380w_600h_n/public/2024-10/1588568.jpg?h=be7d0682&amp;itok=ej-AlW9W 1380w" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/jpeg" sizes="(min-width: 1540px) 1380px, (min-width: 992px) calc(100vw - 160px), calc(100vw - 160px)" width="1380" height="600"/>
              <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/1_6_567w_354h_n/public/2024-10/1588568.jpg?h=be7d0682&amp;itok=KQIe_tf7 567w, /sites/default/files/styles/1_6_819w_512h_n/public/2024-10/1588568.jpg?h=be7d0682&amp;itok=DAVvonBu 819w" media="all and (max-width: 991px)" type="image/jpeg" sizes="(min-width: 740px) calc(100vw - 80px), (min-width: 320px) calc(100vw - 32px), 288px" width="819" height="512"/>
