                          <div class="aalto-single-liftup__body">
                                  <h2 id="liftup-title-id-1356122404">Scholarships and Tuition Fees</h2>
                                                  <p>Bachelor&#039;s and Master&#039;s programmes have a tuition fee for non-EU/EEA citizens. Prospective students subject to tuition fees can apply for Aalto University Excellence Scholarship.</p>
                              </div>
                          <a href="/en/admission-services/scholarships-and-tuition-fees" class="highlight">Read more</a>

